Viewing the repository, linking to the repository or website, and rights that GitHub itself provides under its Terms of Service are not expanded by this license. Nothing in this license is intended to restrict rights that cannot lawfully be restricted, including any applicable statutory exceptions or limitations to copyright.

3. PRIOR WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION REQUIRED

Anyone wishing to reuse any SanLean Materials must first obtain express written authorization from SanLean. Authorization for one person, organization, project, purpose, version, or use does not automatically authorize any other use.

SanLean may approve or reject a request and may establish additional conditions in the written authorization.

4. MANDATORY ATTRIBUTION AFTER AUTHORIZATION

Unless SanLean expressly waives or changes these requirements in writing, every authorized public use must include a clearly visible and reasonably prominent attribution accessible to users of the resulting website, application, product, or project.

The attribution must:

(a) identify “SanLean” as the source/original creator of the authorized SanLean Materials;
(b) include a working hyperlink to the official SanLean website: https://sanlean17.github.io/ ; and
(c) not imply that SanLean endorses, sponsors, operates, or is affiliated with the authorized user's project unless SanLean separately agrees to that representation in writing.

A suggested attribution is:
“Contains code/materials originally created by SanLean — https://sanlean17.github.io/ — used with permission.”

Attribution alone does NOT create permission. Written authorization must be obtained first.

5. NO RELICENSING OR TRANSFER

Unless expressly authorized in writing by SanLean, an authorized user may not sublicense, sell, assign, transfer, or grant third parties independent rights to the SanLean Materials.

6. THIRD-PARTY MATERIALS

This license applies only to rights owned or controlled by SanLean. It does not grant rights to third-party trademarks, characters, artwork, images, names, game assets, fonts, libraries, code, or other materials.

Dead by Daylight and related names, characters, artwork, trademarks, game assets, and other intellectual property belong to Behaviour Interactive Inc. and/or their respective rights holders. Any third-party content remains subject to its own applicable rights, licenses, permissions, and terms.

7. RESERVATION OF RIGHTS

All rights not expressly granted in a separate written authorization are reserved by SanLean. This repository is not offered under an open-source license.

